<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates ease to 3.75-4.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates ease to 3.75-4.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Jordanian dinar eased slightly on Thursday to 3.75-4.25 percent from 4.00-4.50 percent on Wednesday, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the market was expected to tighten on Saturday as lender banks again tie up more funds in the latest 15 million dinar CD (certificate of deposits) issue, which offers more attractive interest of 9.25 to 9.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
